30. Fork

Purpose:
Creates a copy of another user's repository in your GitHub account.
Mostly used for Open Source contributions.

Workflow:

Original Repository
        │
        ▼
Fork
        │
        ▼
Your Repository

31. Pull Request vs Fork
Pull Request	                                Fork
Merge changes into another branch	           Create a copy of a repository
Used in company projects	                    Used mostly in Open Source
Requires repository access	                    Does not require write access
